Here is a snippet of the `process` method in the `PosixParser` class:

```java
private void process(String value) {
    if ((currentOption != null) && currentOption.hasArg()) {
        if (currentOption.hasArg()) {
            tokens.add(value);
            currentOption = null;
        } else if (currentOption.hasArgs()) {
            tokens.add(value);
        }
    } else {
        eatTheRest = true;
        tokens.add("--");
        tokens.add(value);
    }
}
```

